From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] hg5585f: trace WED attach stages and guard WED IRQ storms

mt7915e probe on the -wed image stalls after "enabling device" and CPU0
is starved in softirq (RCU stall). Trace WED attach stages and raw status
through airoha_wlan_dbg() (default on), and add a hard-IRQ-side storm guard
that disables the WED line once, with a compiled regression test.

